OL,3,GNEWSAFire in vehicle workshop forces
OL,4,Aresidents from homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents were forced to leave their
OL,7,Fhomes after a fire broke out in a
OL,8,Fvehicle workshop in the early hours.
OL,10,FSix fire engines, a water carrier and
OL,11,Fan aerial ladder platform were sent to
OL,12,Fthe blaze on Burgess Road in
OL,13,FSwaythling, Southampton, at about 03:00
OL,14,FGMT.
OL,16,FFirefighters are working to tackle the
OL,17,Ffire with some residents living close
OL,18,Fto the workshop forced to leave their
OL,19,Fhomes.
OL,21,FThe A35 Burgess Road remains closed
OL,22,Ffrom the A335 Thomas Lewis Way.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
